* ''The DNS credential'': the registrar's credential rests as two files on the first operator's always-on node, outside both mounts, read by the one-shot issuer. That node issues one wildcard per machine, and the second machine receives its certificate by hand. After the hearth stands, move the credential into the vault's Porkbun VEIL slot (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/reach-plane`>>).

